%5Cn%3Cli%20class%3D%5C%22MsoNormal%5C%22%3ELive%20shows%3C%2Fli%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3Cli%20class%3D%5C%22MsoNormal%5C%22%3ESuperstar%20LEGO%20characters%20ready%20to%20make%20memories%20with%20you!%3C%2Fli%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3C%2Ful%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3Cp%20class%3D%5C%22MsoNormal%5C%22%3EAnd%20the%20best%20part%3F%20On%20top%20of%20all%20the%20LEGO%20Festival%20excitement%2C%20you%20can%20still%20enjoy%20every%20ride%2C%20attraction%2C%20and%20show%20that%20makes%20LEGOLAND%20so%20unforgettable.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3Cp%20class%3D%5C%22MsoNormal%5C%22%3EIt%E2%80%99s%20the%20ultimate%20celebration%20of%20play%20%26%238211%3B%20only%20at%20LEGOLAND%20this%20summer.%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22startDate%22%3A%222026-07-20T04%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%2C%22nextDate%22%3A%222026-08-14T03%3A59%3A59.000Z%22%2C%22endDate%22%3A%222026-08-17T03%3A59%3A59.000Z%22%2C%22venue%22%3A%7B%22_id%22%3A%22680fa86cdb412b6fb22a5e47%22%2C%22zip%22%3A%2233884%22%2C%22address1%22%3A%22One%20LEGOLAND%20Way%22%2C%22region%22%3A%22Surrounding%20Areas%2FDay%20Trips%22%2C%22city%22%3A%22Winter%20Haven%22%2C%22acctid%22%3A113922%2C%22state%22%3A%22FL%22%2C%22recid%22%3A31833%2C%22rankname%22%3A%22Standard%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22LEGOLAND%C2%AE%20Florida%20Resort%22%2C%22primary_category%22%3A%7B%22primary%22%3Atrue%2C%22subcatid%22%3A2916%2C%22subcatname%22%3A%22Theme%20Parks%22%2C%22catname%22%3A%22Theme%20Parks%22%2C%22catid%22%3A489%7D%2C%22featuredItem%22%3Afalse%2C%22memberInfo%22%3A%22LEGOLAND%C2%AE%20Florida%20Resort%20%7C%20Winter%20Haven%2C%20FL%20%7C%2031833%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22680fa86cdb412b6fb22a5e47%22%2C%22detailURL%22%3A%22%2Flisting%2Flegoland%25c2%25ae-florida-resort%2F31833%2F%22%2C%22genericUrl%22%3A%22%2Flisting%2Flegoland%25c2%25ae-florida-resort%2F31833%2F%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Flisting%2Flegoland%25c2%25ae-florida-resort%2F31833%2F%22%2C%22absolute_url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.visitorlando.com%2Flisting%2Flegoland%25c2%25ae-florida-resort%2F31833%2F%22%2C%22isListing%22%3Atrue%2C%22hasTripAdvisor%22%3Afalse%2C%22hasYel