inary%20Green%20Park%20in%20downtown%20Orlando!%20Running%20nightly%20through%20Labor%20Day%20on%20September%207%2C%20the%20park%E2%80%99s%20projection%20show%20has%20transformed%20into%20a%20red%2C%20white%2C%20and%20blue%20celebration%20of%20the%20nation%E2%80%99s%20semiquincentennial.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3Cp%20class%3D%5C%22MsoNormal%5C%22%3EThe%20free%20outdoor%20experience%20begins%20at%20sunset%20each%20evening%20and%20runs%20through%2010%20p.m.%2C%20making%20it%20a%20perfect%20addition%20to%20a%20nighttime%20stroll%20through%20Creative%20Village.%20While%20the%20patriotic%20projection%20show%20traditionally%20only%20takes%20place%20during%20the%20week%20of%20July%204%2C%20this%20year%E2%80%99s%20extended%20run%20gives%20residents%20and%20visitors%20more%20opportunities%20to%20enjoy%20the%20immersive%20display%20all%20summer%20long.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3Cp%20class%3D%5C%22MsoNormal%5C%22%3EBring%20your%20family%2C%20meet%20up%20with%20friends%2C%20or%20simply%20stop%20by%20to%20take%20in%20the%20visuals.%20No%20tickets%20or%20reservations%20are%20required%20-%20just%20show%20up%20and%20enjoy%20this%20free%20community%20experience%20at%20Luminary%20Green%20Park.%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22startDate%22%3A%222026-05-25T04%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%2C%22nextDate%22%3A%222026-08-14T03%3A59%3A59.000Z%22%2C%22endDate%22%3A%222026-09-08T03%3A59%3A59.000Z%22%2C%22recurrence%22%3A%22Recurring%20daily%22%2C%22location%22%3A%22Luminary%20Green%20Park%22%2C%22categories%22%3A%5B%7B%22catName%22%3A%22Holidays%22%2C%22catId%22%3A%224%22%7D%2C%7B%22catName%22%3A%22Free%20Events%22%2C%22catId%22%3A%2223%22%7D%2C%7B%22catName%22%3A%22Date%20Night%22%2C%22catId%22%3A%2224%22%7D%2C%7B%22catName%22%3A%22America%20250%22%2C%22catId%22%3A%2225%22%7D%5D%2C%22primarycatid%22%3A%224%22%2C%22city%22%3A%22Orlando%22%2C%22state%22%3A%22FL%22%2C%22accountId%22%3A200642%2C%22featured%22%3Afalse%2C%22link%22%3A%7B%22url%22%3A%22%2Fevent%2Fred-white-and-blue-nights%2F34737%2F%22%7D%2C%22asset%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3