A0%3Cem%3EThe%20Magic%20Show%3A%20Unboxed%3C%2Fem%3E%2C%20an%20extraordinary%2C%20highly%20rated%20experience%20and%20established%20residency%20appearing%20exclusively%20at%20Grande%20Lakes%20Orlando.%20Created%20and%20performed%20by%20America%E2%80%99s%20Got%20Talent%20finalist%20Drew%20Thomas%2C%20this%20intimate%20production%20goes%20far%20beyond%20traditional%20magic%E2%80%94inviting%20you%20into%20the%20story%20behind%20the%20illusion%20with%20energy%2C%20humor%2C%20and%20nonstop%20audience%20engagement.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3Cp%3EIn%20this%20reimagined%20theatrical%20experience%2C%20the%20box%20is%20more%20than%20a%20prop%2C%20it%E2%80%99s%20a%20symbol.%20As%20it%20opens%2C%20so%20does%20a%20world%20of%20wonder%20filled%20with%20laugh-out-loud%20moments%2C%20impossible%20feats%2C%20and%20truly%20astonishing%20surprises.%20Guests%20consistently%20rave%20about%20how%20interactive%2C%20funny%2C%20and%20engaging%20the%20show%20is%2C%20where%20you%E2%80%99re%20not%20just%20watching%20the%20magic%2C%20you%E2%80%99re%20part%20of%20it.%20Joined%20by%20his%20wife%20Rebecca%2C%20Drew%20blends%20world-class%20illusions%20with%20playful%20charm%20and%20heartfelt%20storytelling.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3Cp%3EThroughout%20the%20evening%2C%20subtle%20moments%20of%20live%20music%20by%20Sam%2C%20Milo%2C%20and%20Kayla%20add%20a%20cinematic%20texture%20without%20ever%20slowing%20the%20pace.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3Cp%3EPerformed%20just%20steps%20from%20the%20audience%2C%C2%A0%3Cem%3EUnboxed%3C%2Fem%3E%C2%A0is%20high-energy%2C%20unforgettable%20fun%E2%80%94where%20astonishment%20and%20laughter%20collide.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cr%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EImage%20courtesy%20of%20Drew%20Thomas%20Magic%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22startDate%22%3A%222026-03-05T05%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%2C%22nextDate%22%3A%222026-08-14T03%3A59%3A59.000Z%22%2C%22endDate%22%3A%222026-09-07T03%3A59%3A59.000Z%22%2C%22venue%22%3A%7B%22_id%22%3A%22680fa86cdb412b6fb22a5a20%22%2C%22zip%22%3A%2232837%22%2C%22address1%22%3A%224012%20Central%20Flori